{"unit_id":"hyqhyq3__dsh-gemini-oauth-bridge#card-zh","repo":"hyqhyq3/dsh-gemini-oauth-bridge","commit":"4be5cf12d0ef81381d8d30c2de3f6e1d96d56e05","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-gemini-oauth-bridge 是 DSH Web 客户端的模型接入插件，通过 Google OAuth 将 Gemini 订阅模型包装为 OpenAI 兼容 provider。它增加 Gemini OAuth 设置页，登录后获取模型并同步 provider。主要功能包括模型发现、chat completions 接口、OpenAI 与 Gemini 对话和工具调用格式转换，以及流式响应。适合希望在 DSH 中使用 Google AI 订阅模型的用户；需授权 Google 账号，插件会自动配置 provider。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1164-1207","lib/protocol.js:261-379","lib/index.js:655-675"]}
